# Contact form using native form elements.

title "Contact us"
text "We usually reply within a day."

space

section
    input "name" "Your name"
    email "email" "Your email"
    textarea "message" "What's on your mind?"
    checkbox "subscribe" "Subscribe to our newsletter"
    radio "plan" "starter" "Starter"
    radio "plan" "pro" "Pro"
    radio "plan" "team" "Team"
    button "Send" "#"
